    '한 점에서 만나요':['They meet at one point','Se cortan en un punto','Elles se coupent en un point','Sie schneiden sich in einem Punkt','1点で交わります',"交于一点","Elas se cruzam num ponto","Пересекаются в одной точке","Bir noktada kesişirler","They meet at one goodcount","그들 meet 에서 하나 점"],
