    '100000개 더 찍기':['Add 100000 more points','Añadir 100000 puntos más','Ajouter 100000 points','100000 Punkte mehr','100000個多く打つ',"再加 100000 个点","Mais 100000 pontos","Ещё 100000 точек","100000 nokta daha ekle","Plus 100000 plusgoodcounts","더하다 100000 더 점들"],
