    '중심각':['Central angle','Ángulo central','Angle au centre','Mittelpunktswinkel','中心角',"圆心角","Ângulo central","Центральный угол","Merkez açı","Central angle","중앙의 angle"],
    '중심각 {0}°':['Central angle {0}°','Ángulo central {0}°','Angle au centre {0}°','Mittelpunktswinkel {0}°','中心角 {0}°',"圆心角 {0}°","Ângulo central {0}°","Центральный угол {0}°","Merkez açı {0}°","Central angle {0}°","중앙의 angle {0}°"],
    '원주각 ∠APB':['Inscribed angle ∠APB','Ángulo inscrito ∠APB','Angle inscrit ∠APB','Umfangswinkel ∠APB','円周角 ∠APB',"圆周角 ∠APB","Ângulo inscrito ∠APB","Вписанный угол ∠APB","Çevre açı ∠APB","Inscribed angle ∠APB","원주각 ∠APB"],
